{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "2.1.9 and 2.5 are different protocols: a server answers the wrong one with silence, so a tunnel that never comes up is what a wrong choice here looks like.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2.1.9 and 2.5 are different protocols: a server answers the wrong one with silence, so a tunnel that never comes up is what a wrong choice here looks like."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2.1.9 и 2.5 — разные протоколы: сервер отвечает на чужой молчанием, поэтому неверный выбор выглядит как туннель, который никак не поднимается."
          }
        }
      }
    },
